  "title": "Exquisite Pie",
  "description": "This rich, wonderfully sweet pie is studded with oodles of coconut, pecans, and golden raisins. Sugar, eggs, butter, lemon juice, vinegar and vanilla are combined with them and baked until set. This recipe yields two exquisite pies.",
  "authors": [
